---
import TextPage from '@/layouts/TextPage.astro';
import Button from '@/components/Button.astro';
import ExternalLink from '@/components/ExternalLink.astro';
import { KOFI_URL } from '@/config/site';
import { breadcrumbJsonLd } from '@/lib/seo';
import ContactEmail from '@/components/ContactEmail.astro';
---

<TextPage
  title="Support Taren"
  description="Taren is independent. If you enjoy the work, you can support future development with a small, optional contribution on Ko-fi."
  eyebrow="Support"
  heading="Enjoying what we’re building?"
  intro="Taren projects are created independently. If you enjoy the work, you can support future development with a small, optional contribution."
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbJsonLd([{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Support', path: '/support/' }])]}
>
  <div slot="before" class="container-x pt-14 md:pt-20">
    <div class="flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-5 rounded-(--radius-card) border border-line bg-surface p-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:p-9">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-xl tracking-[-0.02em] text-text">Support on Ko-fi</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Opens ko-fi.com/taren in a new tab.</p>
      </div>
      <Button href={KOFI_URL} external size="lg" data-kofi-link>Support on Ko-fi</Button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Completely optional</h2>
  <p>
    Support is never required. Nothing on this site, and nothing in a free Taren project, is locked behind a
    contribution. If you cannot or would rather not contribute, you are just as welcome.
  </p>

  <h2>What your support does</h2>
  <p>
    Contributions help Taren spend more time on its projects. A contribution is a voluntary tip: it does not buy a
    product, a service, a licence or priority, and it does not change what you get from a free project.
  </p>

  <h2>How payments work</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Payments are handled entirely by <ExternalLink href={KOFI_URL}>Ko-fi</ExternalLink> and its payment providers.
      Taren never sees or stores your card or bank details.
    </li>
    <li>You choose whether to contribute and how much.</li>
    <li>
      Ko-fi may pass details you give it, such as your name, message and email address, on to Taren so the
      contribution can be acknowledged. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Ko-fi’s own terms and privacy policy apply to anything you do on Ko-fi. This website does not embed Ko-fi or load
      any of its scripts; the link above is an ordinary link.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Questions about supporting Taren are welcome by email: <ContactEmail />.</p>

  <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
  <p>
    Trying a project, sharing it with someone who might enjoy it, or reporting a problem you found are all genuinely
    useful — and free.
  </p>
</TextPage>
